{{Quote|text=Don't hesitate to ask if you require my bow.}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an antisocial NPC and an adventurer from Castle Village. As a skilled sniper, [[Marlon]] contracts her to work at the [[Stardew:Guild|Adventurer's Guild]].

Alesia is well-mannered and proud of her work. She previously lived in the valley, but found her true belonging among the monster hunters of Castle Village. Additionally, she is a devout believer of [[Stardew:Yoba|Yoba]].
{{TOC|limit=2}}

